    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπί-λῠσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>release from</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. φόβων δίδου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					134
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): abs., <i>exemption</i> from banishment, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				306.51
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Arc.
			</span></i>, <span class="entity">iv B.C.</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>solution</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σοφισμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.246
				</span></i>
			; <i>explanation</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>2 Ep.Pet.</u>
				1.20
			</span></i>, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				172.3
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Protr.</u>
				21
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>.
				<i>discharge</i>, of a debt, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δοῦναί
				τισιν ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				27.23
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.26.27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <i>spell,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PMag.Leid.W.
				25.11
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>. Medic.,
				<i>change of</i>
			<i>dressing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.28
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(2).838
			</span></i>(pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Paul.Aeg.
				4.48
			</span></i>.</div>
